{
  "slug": "duckdb-skills",
  "name": "Duckdb Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "DuckDB-powered skills for Claude Code: read any data file, attach and query DuckDB databases, search DuckDB/DuckLake docs, search past session logs, and install/update DuckDB extensions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `attach-db` (Attach a DuckDB database file for use with /duckdb-skills:query), `convert-file` (Convert any data file to another format: CSV, Parquet, JSON, Excel, GeoJSON, and more), `duckdb-docs` (Search DuckDB and DuckLake documentation and blog posts), `install-duckdb` (Install or update DuckDB extensions), `query` (Run SQL queries against the attached DuckDB database or ad-hoc against files), `read-file` (Read any data file (CSV, JSON, Parquet, Avro, Excel, spatial, SQLite) or remote URL (S3, HTTPS)), `read-memories` (Search past Claude Code session logs to recall prior decisions, patterns, or unresolved work), `s3-explore` (Explore and query data on S3, Cloudflare R2, GCS, MinIO, or any S3-compatible storage), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install duckdb-skills@claude-plugins-official` from `duckdb/duckdb-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
